TOTOTOFU PORTFOLIO: THE MASTER FLOW (FUTURE -> ANCIENT -> REBOOT)

Core Narrative: A descent from rigid, high-performance digital engineering
down into chaotic, organic physics, ending with a hard snap back to reality.

Global Constant: The t.tofu Fast-Travel Artifact sits in the corner,
degrading from Chrome -> Glass -> Sunken Metal -> Stone as the user scrolls.

PHASE 1: THE INITIATION (Future / Fire)

[ SECTION: HERO ]

Visual: Deep Matte Slate (#0F172A). Hyper-clean, rigid typography (Syne/Space Grotesk).

Interaction: User discovers the "Gacha Mask." Hovering the main avatar photo
creates a flashlight-mask revealing an ASCII/Pixel version. Clicking locks
it in.

Vibe: "I am a serious, high-end engineer."

[ TRANSITION 1: THE THERMAL BLEED ]

The "Scroll to Descend" text physically melts via SVG filters. A deep
orange plasma glow bleeds up from the bottom of the screen. The Gacha mask
unmounts; the cursor becomes a Plasma Reticle.

[ SECTION: ABOUT ]

Visual: Still Deep Slate, but lit by an ambient orange/amber core.

Interaction: The bio text is an unreadable, blurry "Heat Haze". The user
must physically drag their cursor over it to "cool" and read it. Clicking
the UI boxes triggers a 1.5s plasma border melt.

Vibe: "My code is powerful, volatile, and deeply interactive."

PHASE 2: THE DESCENT (Modern / Air)

[ TRANSITION 2: THE VR PORTAL ]

The Plasma Reticle morphs into a glowing silver VR Headset.

The camera zooms aggressively into the headset lenses. The screen flashes
and inverts from Dark Mode to Light Mode (#F8FAFC).

[ SECTION: PROJECTS ]

Visual: Light Slate. Frosted glass project cards suspended in an invisible
aerodynamic grid.

Interaction: Wind Physics. Moving the mouse pushes the dangling cards.
Clicking empty space spawns a Gravity Well that sucks the cards together.
Users must physically "click and drag" a card to tear it open and view details.

Vibe: "I build frictionless, modern, high-pressure UI."

PHASE 3: THE ABYSS (Ancient / Water & Earth)

[ TRANSITION 3: THE SHATTER & FLOOD ]

As pressure builds, the Light Slate glass viewport shatters into falling
polygons.

A WebGL ink-drop displaces the falling glass, flooding the screen with
Deep Indigo (#0A1128). Vertical scrolling halts and maps to horizontal panning.

[ SECTION: SKILLS ]

Visual: A dark, bioluminescent deep-sea trench. Horizontal cinematic scroll.

Interaction: Boids Algorithm. The user's skills (Python, React) are glowing
fish flocking around coral reefs (AI, UI). The cursor acts as bait. Clicking
drops food, causing a feeding frenzy.

Vibe: "I understand complex math, self-sustaining systems, and shaders."

[ TRANSITION 4: THE ASCENT & THE WASH ]

The horizontal timeline ends. The camera pitches up, breaking the water's
surface with a flash. The background becomes Pitch Black (#000000).

Scroll mapping changes to a rhythmic 1st-person "Head Bob" walking motion.

A giant, dirt-covered rock approaches. A WebGL wave crashes against the screen,
washing away the dirt mask to reveal carved text beneath.

[ SECTION: CONTACT ]

Visual: Pure Pitch Black.

Interaction: The user is blind. The cursor is a 250px Radial Flashlight
revealing the amber contact links carved in the stone. Finding and clicking
the hidden "Torch Bracket" permanently ignites the cave with warm firelight.

Vibe: "I reward users who explore and engage."

PHASE 4: THE SYSTEM REBOOT (Deja Vu)

[ TRANSITION 5: THE HARD SNAP ]

The user scrolls past the bottom of the cave, crossing a 1px solid line.

The threshold reads: > system.override(tototofu); // take off headset.

Instant visual cut. Zero easing. Zero fading. The cave and all WebGL
contexts are violently destroyed.

[ SECTION: FOOTER ]

Visual: We are instantly back in the Deep Matte Slate (#0F172A) environment
from the Hero section.

Interaction: None. A perfectly static, highly rigid, ultra-accessible
4-column grid of links.

Vibe: "I can build chaotic magic, but I never forget how to build
clean, accessible, production-ready software."